# Homebrew manifest for the SwiftFormat + SwiftLint toolchain.
#
# Install or repair it on any Mac with Homebrew, from this repo root:
#
#     brew bundle
#
# `brew bundle` reads this file (./Brewfile), installs anything missing, and is
# idempotent — run it once during onboarding and again after this file changes.
#
# Versions: the Brewfile DSL installs the *current* formula, so it guarantees
# the tools are *present*, not that they match CI exactly. CI pins the exact
# SwiftFormat version (see .github/workflows/pr-checks.yml). Keep these in step:
#
#     swiftformat 0.63.0
#     swiftlint   0.65.1
#
# If exact-version parity across the team is ever required, that needs a
# version manager (mise/asdf) rather than a Brewfile.

brew "swiftformat"
brew "swiftlint"
